      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `document_client.py` file with local configuration and client helper utilities for OCR and Layout Extraction, I need to include the necessary imports and configurations for a cloud-based OCR and layout extraction service. I will use Amazon Textract as the service provider for this task, as it is a well-known service for document text extraction. I will include the necessary AWS SDK imports, configuration setup, and a helper function to call the Textract API. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
